title: AWS EBS Volume
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS EBS volume metrics via CloudWatch.
 It provides visibility into volume performance and capacity.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Read/Write Ops: IOPS operations count

 - Read/Write Throughput: Data transfer in bytes

 - Queue Length: Average I/O queue length (important for performance)

 - Burst Balance: Remaining burst credits percentage (critical for gp2 volumes)

 - Idle Time: Time volume spent idle

 - Read/Write Latency: Calculated average latency per operation

 Thresholds can be configured for IOPS, throughput, queue length, and
 burst balance (lower bound).

discovery:
 One service is created for each EBS volume discovered.
